PIk2AkT1FR8423nH5xUOxEujdFMf2I3YU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzJbHMrrwQbf4Dm7IzXZg1Jn1aItyit85otdL1JpOQ3sg&oe=69AEB2F2"}, "display_name": "Synth Riders Demo", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Synth Riders Demo will no longer be supported on Meta Quest devices and new users will no longer be able to search & install this app. If you already \"own\" this entitlement, you will continue to have access.\n\n---------\n\nA FREESTYLE-DANCE RHYTHM ALTERNATIVE\n\nCUSTOM SONGS officially supported - never breaks with an update\nGOOD FITNESS - activates whole body without repetitive movements\nGREAT MUSIC \u2013 74 free and 67 DLC songs from Gorillaz, Muse & more\n\nIn the demo, you can play 7 songs on all difficulty levels and experiment with all the modifiers - unlimited!\n\nThe full version of Synth Riders is available on the Meta Quest Store featuring:\n\n\u2022 135 Songs - 74 free and 67 DLC, including Gorillaz, Muse, Caravan Palace, The Offspring and more!\n\u2022 Official Custom Song Support\n\u2022 Cross-Platform Multiplayer\n\u2022 360\u00b0 Spin Mode in Every Song\n\u2022 Party mode - local multiplayer\n\nWe hope you will enjoy the demo and join the Synth Riders community soon!", "short_description": "Synth Riders Demo will no longer be supported on Meta Quest devices and new users will no longer be able to search & install this app. If you already \"own\" this entitlement, you will continue to have access.\n\n---------\n\nWelcome to the demo of Synth Riders - a freestyle dancing VR rhythm alternative. The demo comes with 5 songs on all difficulty levels with all the modifiers!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://synthridersvr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Kluge Interactive", "support_website_url": "https://synthridersvr.com/contact-us/", "website_url": "https://www.synthridersvr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": 